# the motion loop and the gliding knobs (2026-10-10 review): the loop goes back to its start gliding
# over the Morph time (0.62 s), not in a jump; a recording runs past 30 s (up to 5 minutes)
# drone I's filter LFO and the Drift at 0 (the default breathes and wanders), so the cutoff probe sees the
# knob alone
tap LFO
spin K2 -25
expect par17 0
tap GLO
spin K3 -30
expect par52 0
tap HOME
expect view 0
tap PLAY
wait 1500
expect par0 5000
# the cutoff glides between a slow turn's detents (each over the time since the last): half way between
# two detents 300 ms apart, it's half way (not still on the first step, as the old 60 ms smoothing left it)
expect par7 700
turn K2 1 10
wait 300
turn K2 1 10
wait 150
expect cut0 >7120
expect cut0 <7185
spin K2 -2
expect par7 700
# SEL held: cutoff in tenths (a detent 1, not 10)
press SEL
spin K2 3
release SEL
expect par7 703
spin K2 -1
expect par7 693
spin K2 1
press SEL
spin K2 -3
release SEL
expect par7 700
tap REC
expect loop 1
wait 200
turn K1 10 200
wait 500
expect par0 >5500
# loop: back to the start (5000), gliding: 0.1 s in, still most of the way up
tap REC
expect loop 2
wait 100
expect pitch0 >5350
wait 150
expect pitch0 >5150
tap REC
expect loop 0
# a long recording: still recording at 40 s (a knob moved at 35 s, so it has something to loop)
tap REC
expect loop 1
wait 35000
spin K2 2
wait 5000
expect loop 1
tap REC
expect loop 2
tap REC
expect loop 0
# SEL + PLAY: drone II alone fades out (drone I plays on), and back in
press SEL
tap PLAY
release SEL
expect playing 1
wait 2500
expect level1 0
expect level0 >3
press SEL
tap PLAY
release SEL
wait 2500
expect level1 >3
